  "chitchat": [
    "\"Thin pan, thin cook. Buy iron once and be done.\"",
    "She rings a skillet with a knuckle and listens to it the way other people listen to a doctor.",
    "\"Everything on that wall outlived the kitchen it came out of. Bear that in mind.\"",
    "\"You can have cheap, or you can have a pan. Not both, not from me.\""
  ],
  "description": "A short, thick-forearmed woman with grey cropped to the scalp and two fingertips gone to the first knuckle on her left hand. She handles every piece that comes over the counter twice, once to weigh it and once to ring it, and prices it on the sound.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "She goes back to the rail, straightening handles that were already straight."
    },
    "iron": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "So what should I buy?",
          "next": "shop"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Heat's the whole job. Thin steel takes the flame and hands it straight to your food in one spot, and that's how you get a black middle and a raw edge. Iron takes its time and gives it back even.\" She taps the skillet. \"Costs more. Weighs more. Outlives you.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Show me what you've got.",
          "next": "shop"
        },
        {
          "label": "Why's the iron cost four times the steel?",
          "next": "iron"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Look with your eyes first.\" She doesn't stop what she's doing. \"If you want it down off the rail, say so.\""
    },
    "shop": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "OPEN_SHOP",
          "npcId": "npc_kitchenware_smith"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(look it over)",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Rail's the pans, casing's the small stuff. Range is there if you want to hear a pan before you pay for it.\""
    }
  },
